      "id": "claim_c7fdade80c7542f2b482cf732f975faf",
      "statement": "Cart functions (addToCart, setCartQuantity, removeFromCart, cartTotals, toOrderItems) are pure functions operating on arrays with no server calls. Prices in the cart are display-only — the service reads unit_amount from its own catalog when building the Checkout session.",
