    {
      "id": "claim_13188c62fe4046578f7d6c56e9dbe1da",
      "statement": "The CLI setup runner emits ProgressEvent objects (step name, state, index, total) via an onProgress callback. The SetupReport includes per-step state (satisfied, applied, missing, failed, skipped), duration, and an ok flag. Exit code 0 means every step satisfied or applied, 1 means a step failed, 2 means a dry run found work outstanding.",
