    {
      "id": "claim_9500b9f2c90d44aa82d7c9e9a386fca8",
      "statement": "The CLI's loadSetup function resolves the setup file from the working directory (conventional names: ulabase.setup.ts, .mts, .js, .mjs) or from --file. It provides targeted error messages for missing packages (bare specifier resolution), missing relative imports (extension required), and TypeScript files on older Node (needs tsx or Node 22.18+).",
